{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Alright, vitals before the doctor. Have a seat.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): I'm fine. Honestly, err, this is a waste of everybody's time.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Thanks for squeezing us in. I'm his sister, I drove him over.",
  "[SEG0004] person_1 (NURSE): Blood pressure is one oh nine over seventy-seven. Pulse seventy-two, no, seventy-six.",
  "[SEG0005] person_1 (NURSE): Temp's thirty-six point eight. Oxygen sat 98 percent. Last time in March your pulse was sixty-eight.",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): See. Normal. Can we move.",
  "[SEG0007] person_1 (NURSE): Mm. My sister's boy gets those staring spells. She pulled him right off his bike team. Doctor'll be in.",
  "[SEG0008] person_4 (DOCTOR): Morning. What brings you in.",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (PATIENT): I need you to clear me to drive. That's the whole thing. I've been fine.",
  "[SEG0010] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): I booked it, actually. Something happened last month and he won't talk about it.",
  "[SEG0011] person_4 (DOCTOR): Epilepsy still? Still on Keppra?",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah, the white pills, by mouth. Five hundred twice a day. Wait, no, they upped it, it's seven fifty twice a day.",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): He missed a bunch on that Denver trip.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): Umm, two mornings. That's it. I was fine.",
  "[SEG0015] person_4 (DOCTOR): Any shaking seizures?",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (PATIENT): No. None for two years. I've had this ten years, uh, no, eight years, and two of those clean.",
  "[SEG0017] person_4 (DOCTOR): Tongue biting?",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (PATIENT): Nope.",
  "[SEG0019] person_4 (DOCTOR): Lose control of your bladder?",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Geez.",
  "[SEG0021] person_4 (DOCTOR): Headaches?",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0023] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): Last month at my kitchen table he went blank. Stared at the wall, didn't answer, about a minute.",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): I did not blank out. I was thinking. Nothing happened.",
  "[SEG0025] person_4 (DOCTOR): So no spell.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (PATIENT): Right. No spell.",
  "[SEG0027] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): He didn't blink. I said his name three times. I can't remember the exact day, though.",
  "[SEG0028] person_4 (DOCTOR): When you skip the Keppra, the level in your blood drops, the brakes come off the brain's electrical firing, and a seizure can slip through. That's the mechanism.",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (PATIENT): Two mornings of kepra. I'm not falling apart over two mornings.",
  "[SEG0030] person_4 (DOCTOR): Any warning, a smell, a rising feeling, anything like that?",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0032] person_4 (DOCTOR): Breathing trouble?",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0034] person_4 (DOCTOR): Stomach problems?",
  "[SEG0035] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0036] person_4 (DOCTOR): Sleep alright? Any daytime sleepiness?",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (PATIENT): Sleep's fine. I'm not sleepy.",
  "[SEG0038] person_4 (DOCTOR): Alcohol?",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (PATIENT): I don't drink. Never have.",
  "[SEG0040] person_4 (DOCTOR): What do you do for work?",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (PATIENT): I deliver auto parts. I need the car. I've been driving anyway, it's whatever.",
  "[SEG0042] person_4 (DOCTOR): I'm not signing off on driving today.",
  "[SEG0043] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): It was real, I know what I saw. He was just gone.",
  "[SEG0044] person_4 (DOCTOR): Could be a focal seizure with impaired awareness. Could be you just drifted. I can't separate those two today.",
  "[SEG0045] person_2 (PATIENT): It was nothing. You're blowing it up.",
  "[SEG0046] person_4 (DOCTOR): I'll order a Keppra level. The blood draw is booked for this week.",
  "[SEG0047] person_4 (DOCTOR): Do not drive until I review that level and we decide if that was a seizure. Take both doses, every day, no skipping.",
  "[SEG0048] person_2 (PATIENT): So I'm grounded. Fantastic.",
  "[SEG0049] person_4 (DOCTOR): Come back in three weeks. We'll look at the number.",
  "[SEG0050] person_3 (FAMILY_MEMBER): I'll make sure he's here.",
  "[SEG0051] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah, fine. We done?",
  "[SEG0052] person_4 (DOCTOR): Lab first. Then you can go."
 ],
